1_107821e0-fb33-436c-a230-2144fc573148.png?v=1722611000&amp;width=1800" media="(min-width: 821px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Frame_1_107821e0-fb33-436c-a230-2144fc573148.png?v=1722611000&amp;width=2048" media="(min-width: 1025px)"/><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0222/9882/0682/files/Frame_1_107821e0-fb33-436c-a230-2144fc573148.png?v=1722611000" alt="A stylized leaf icon on a white background." class="r-pye99c" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="eff6959d-126e-49f1-99fc-373a0dfaec4d" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-14rg6pb alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span>History & Origin</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="8acd661f-65ff-4585-9437-ab8a16165255" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0.0" class="r-1tv5l9u alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>King Salmon is part of the culture and traditions of Indigenous peoples of the pacific northwest. it holds a place of honor in ceremonies and folklore, symbolizing abundance and resilience.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="3bd1d147-882e-4b62-b2e0-feecf643d07c" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0" class="r-4xha9f"><div data-rid="a961d379-8458-4909-b3d7-72e6303d6147" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-1mnxe2p"><div data-rid="c3e7e1c4-41a8-499e-b78c-8487a4e4d79b" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-zfcz1p alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>How Seatopia delivers certified clean king salmon</p></span></div><div data-rid="7bedd32f-f29f-43f9-8035-5397d54aa871" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-17fhlno alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>We work with artisan farms around the world to source the best king salmon for you. Our farms are small-scale, and the fish are raised in low-density, antibiotic-free conditions, and fed micro-algae-based oils.</p></span></div><div data-rid